<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Reset Password</title>
    <style>
        *{
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .container{
            background-color: #232933;
            padding: 54px;
        }
        .email-text{
            color: rgb(117, 128, 144);
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 27px;
        }
        .bottom-text{
            margin-top: 27px;
        }
        .greet{
            color: white;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 21px;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            margin-bottom: 27px
        }
        .reset-password-link{
            width: 70px;
            height: 54px;
            align-content: center;
            background-color: rgb(57, 71, 90);
            padding: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 4.5px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            color: rgb(186, 187, 195);
            margin: 18px 0;
        }
        .url{
            text-decoration: none;
            width: 100%;
            font-size: 16px;
            word-wrap: break-word;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: rgb(79, 95, 164)
        }
        .line{
            border-top: 1px solid rgb(117, 128, 144);
            padding: 18px 0;
        }
        .footer-text{
            text-align: center;
            padding: 9px 0;
            color: rgb(117, 128, 144);
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .logo{
            height: 50px;
            width: 158px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <img class="logo" src="/img/header_logo.svg" alt='Kaiwa logo'/>
        <p class="greet">Hello {{displayName}},</p>
        <p class="email-text">
            Your Kaiwa password can be reset by clicking the button below. 
            If you did not request a new password, please ignore this email.
        </p>
        <div>
            <a href={{url}} class="reset-password-link">
                Reset Password
            </a>
        </div>
        <p class="email-text bottom-text">
            If you're having trouble clicking the password reset button, copy and paste the following link into your web browser:
        </p>
        <p>
            <a href="{{url}}" class="url">
                {{ url }}
            </a>
        </p>
        <p class="email-text">
            Please do not reply to this email.
        </p>
        <div>
            <p class="line">
            </p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <div class="footer-text">
                &copy; 2024 Kaiwa. All rights reserved.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>